@patterns.command

Purpose:
  Encapsulate request as object.

Owns: references\patterns\command.sdd
UseWhen:
  - need to parameterize actions
  - queuing or logging requests
  - undo/redo support

AvoidWhen:
  - simple direct invocation
  - no need for history or queue

Why:
  Turns requests into first-class citizens.

Related:
  @patterns.strategy

Examples:
  @project.payment
  @project.order

State: +
